# stack, Bot2 casts Bilbo's Gambit on it promising Bot1 the gift: the Inspector returns to Bot2's hand, no one can cast
# spells this turn (Bot2 is refused the Inspector, the refusal), and the Treasure Bot1 creates is a token Bot1 controls
